baseline has shifted.

00:30:57.460 --> 00:30:58.640
And you mentioned that
when you're were talking

00:30:58.640 --> 00:31:01.240
about your journey as
well, so are there days

00:31:01.240 --> 00:31:03.290
or weeks on end where people are different

00:31:03.290 --> 00:31:04.123
than they were before,

00:31:04.123 --> 00:31:06.280
are they is their mood kind of shifted

00:31:06.280 --> 00:31:07.450
for long periods of time

00:31:07.450 --> 00:31:10.390
even on the playing field,
on the court, et cetera

00:31:10.390 --> 00:31:13.580
like has that baseline really
