situational type of thing.

00:31:24.440 --> 00:31:25.980
So I think it's really
helpful how I've kind of

00:31:25.980 --> 00:31:27.653
highlighted those pieces as well

00:31:27.653 --> 00:31:29.090
because I think that's part

00:31:29.090 --> 00:31:30.815
of the nuance and really

00:31:30.815 --> 00:31:33.600
if people can sense that
the baseline has shifted

00:31:33.600 --> 00:31:36.130
like you talked about, that's
a whole nother scenario

00:31:36.130 --> 00:31:39.410
then talking about the mental
