00:31:44.810 --> 00:31:46.170
but just in terms of when we're talking

00:31:46.170 --> 00:31:47.340
to just general population

00:31:47.340 --> 00:31:49.447
that's often something that
we mentioned, just looking

00:31:49.447 --> 00:31:52.230
for those differences and
kind of overall demeanor

00:31:52.230 --> 00:31:53.690
and mood or a shift from kind

00:31:53.690 --> 00:31:57.720
