00:36:13.210 --> 00:36:15.540
something that might touch on
some of those clinical pieces.

00:36:15.540 --> 00:36:17.870
So it kind of depends
on the expansion of it.

00:36:17.870 --> 00:36:19.940
And so I think in some ways
it can be helpful, you know

00:36:19.940 --> 00:36:21.480
when people are bringing
the app to kind of

00:36:21.480 --> 00:36:23.270
if people are willing
to dive in a little bit

00:36:23.270 --> 00:36:26.327
