And it's actually wraps back

00:44:49.740 --> 00:44:50.860
into the point you made earlier too

00:44:50.860 --> 00:44:53.120
about just everything with COVID.

00:44:53.120 --> 00:44:54.310
I feel like, and I could be wrong

00:44:54.310 --> 00:44:56.630
but there is at least from a
coaching standpoint it seems

00:44:56.630 --> 00:44:59.357
like there has been a little
bit more awareness of that.

00:44:59.357 --> 00:45:00.320
And again, I'm talking

00:45:00.320 --> 00:45:03.110
from the outside as a non-college athlete

00:45:03.110 --> 00:45:05.170
but just things I've seen
even remember you know

00:45:05.170 --> 00:45:06.003
I'm a duke grad and think

00:45:06.003 --> 00:45:09.030
about coach K giving the team a couple

00:45:09.030 --> 00:45:10.290
of weeks off instead of playing games

00:45:10.290 --> 00:45:12.360
because he said he was
concerned for his players

00:45:12.360 --> 00:45:14.570
mental health and just
giving them a space.

00:45:14.570 --> 00:45:15.780
So grant this is from the outside

00:45:15.780 --> 00:45:17.250
but I don't ever remember hearing any

00:45:17.250 --> 00:45:19.290
of those conversations beforehand.

00:45:19.290 --> 00:45:21.230
Maybe more so has kind
of been the backlash.

00:45:21.230 --> 00:45:23.200
So I think it's great that you're there

00:45:23.200 --> 00:45:25.270
in a way infiltrating
is not the right word

00:45:25.270 --> 00:45:27.640
but in a sense I mean,
you're on the ground

00:45:27.640 --> 00:45:29.790
having those conversations,
making sure it gets heard

00:45:29.790 --> 00:45:32.030
and hopefully in a way that penetrates

00:45:32.030 --> 00:45:34.950
that people are able to kind
of receive and incorporate.

00:45:34.950 --> 00:45:37.310
- Right. And I think that's
talking about, you know

00:45:37.310 --> 00:45:41.640
the benefits from what's
happened is the awareness

00:45:41.640 --> 00:45:45.720
and the inability to deny the legitimacy

00:45:45.720 --> 00:45:47.080
of mental health issue

00:45:48.220 --> 00:45:50.700
for so many different groups of people.

00:45:50.700 --> 00:45:54.440
So it's I think that's been a

00:45:56.200 --> 00:45:59.320
one of the positives.

00:45:59.320 --> 00:46:01.680
It's also hard to say
of all of this is like

00:46:02.660 --> 00:46:04.960
you can't ignore mental health anymore.

00:46:04.960 --> 00:46:06.250
You know, the crisis is real.

00:46:06.250 --> 00:46:09.220
It was real, it's even worse now.

00:46:09.220 --> 00:46:10.950
And we can't just ignore it.

00:46:10.950 --> 00:46:11.783
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:46:11.783 --> 00:46:13.720
I think that's so important.

00:46:13.720 --> 00:46:15.990
Hopefully that feels encouraging

00:46:15.990 --> 00:46:17.310
and validating the work
that you've been doing

00:46:17.310 --> 00:46:18.143
for years already.

00:46:18.143 --> 00:46:20.210
I mean, I know that what
you're doing is so impactful

00:46:20.210 --> 00:46:21.700
for so many people and just even some

00:46:21.700 --> 00:46:23.410
of the videos that you've put online

00:46:23.410 --> 00:46:24.980
the ways that people have
responded to your work

00:46:24.980 --> 00:46:26.730
I know it goes a long way

00:46:26.730 --> 00:46:29.200
and I assume it's spreading
too like each person

00:46:29.200 --> 00:46:30.420
that you touch is able to kind of share

00:46:30.420 --> 00:46:32.930
that with others around them as well.

00:46:32.930 --> 00:46:35.780
So definitely appreciate
the work that you're doing.

00:46:35.780 --> 00:46:37.340
I feel like a time went really quickly.

00:46:37.340 --> 00:46:39.172
We could probably go on for quite a while.

00:46:39.172 --> 00:46:43.120
Any last words of advice or
wisdom that you want to share

00:46:43.120 --> 00:46:45.180
with the audience in terms
of just the general audience

00:46:45.180 --> 00:46:46.800
and student athletes in particular?

00:46:46.800 --> 00:46:49.570
- Yeah. Well, first of
all thanks for having me.

00:46:49.570 --> 00:46:52.540
I agree it flew by was
great speaking with you.

00:46:52.540 --> 00:46:53.497
I just love to encourage

00:46:53.497 --> 00:46:56.450
